        <mxCell id="-wiF1sSiHtmnBirLCU0Z-6" parent="-wiF1sSiHtmnBirLCU0Z-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- AWS EC2: instancia t4g.small&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- CPU: 2 nucleos basados en arquitectura ARM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Memoria ram: 2 GB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Almacenamiento EBS: 20 GB SSD para sistema operativo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Red &amp;amp; Conectividad: VPC (Hasta 5 Gbps),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; IP pública IPv4 estática dedicada&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Puertos: 22/443 abiertos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Sistema Operativo: Ubuntu Pro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Entorno Backend: Node.js (JavaScript, API RESTful)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Frontend Build: React 18 + Vite 5 + TailwindCSS 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Seguridad y Red: Firewall (Security Groups),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; Certificado SSL/TLS (Cloudflare SSL),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; DNS (Cloudflare DNS),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; Alojamiento web (Cloudflare Pages),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; Conexion segura (Cloudflare Tunnel)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
